      "note": "Model language: the only wire of an output that is unintelligible (gibberish), has neither a statement nor a question (no_request), or shows an ambiguity the model does not resolve (ambiguous, with 2 to 4 reading lines paraphrasing the candidate readings); the host renders a fixed reply per kind and lists the readings as a clarification (DS021)."
